---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Notice | Prodory" description="How Prodory collects and uses enquiry details under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023." path="/legal/privacy/" noindex>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-4 py-16">
    <p class="rounded border border-[#FCD34D] bg-[#FFFBEB] p-4 text-sm text-[#92400E]"><strong>Draft for counsel review.</strong> Not in force until reviewed and approved. The grievance officer's name and contact are placeholders.</p>
    <h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy notice</h1>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Who we are</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[#4B5563]">This notice is issued by {SITE.parent}, which operates Prodory. Head office: {SITE.head.line1}, {SITE.head.line2}, {SITE.head.line3}.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">What we collect</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-[#4B5563]">
      <li>Enquiry details you type: name, work email, company, phone (optional), area of interest and requirement.</li>
      <li>Consent records: whether you agreed to be contacted, and whether you opted in to marketing.</li>
      <li>Technical details needed to rate-limit and prevent spam: a hashed or truncated IP address and the time of the request.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Why we use it</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[#4B5563]">To answer your enquiry (contact consent). If you opt in, to send cloud-native architecture updates. You can withdraw marketing consent at any time using the unsubscribe link in any message.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Where it goes</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[#4B5563]">Enquiries are stored in our customer relationship system. Marketing contacts are managed in our marketing automation system. Both are operated by us.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Your rights and grievances</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[#4B5563]">You may ask what we hold about you, ask us to correct or erase it, and withdraw consent. Contact the grievance officer: <span class="font-semibold">[name and contact to be confirmed]</span>.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Retention</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[#4B5563]">[Retention periods to be set by counsel.]</p>
  </section>
</Base>
